      <p>NEET, JEE Main, GATE, and RRB each set their own photo and signature specifications, and none of them match. NEET wants a 3.5&times;4.5 cm photo between 10–200 KB; GATE enforces exact pixel dimensions and an aspect-ratio range on top of a 5–600 KB limit; RRB's number depends on which recruitment notification (CEN) you're applying under. Use the table below to find your exam, then fix the file with <a href="/resize/">Resize Image</a> and <a href="/compress/">Compress Image</a> — in that order.</p>

